# PyRIT + Garak LLM Security Testing

This notebook runs Microsoft PyRIT attacks followed by NVIDIA Garak security testing against an Ollama LLM.

## Before Running

1. Make sure Ollama is installed and running.
2. Make sure the target model is available in Ollama.
3. Run `ollama list` on your machine to check the exact model name.
4. Connect this notebook to the machine where Ollama is running.
5. Run Cell 2 to install the required Python packages.
6. In Cell 3, update only:
   - `OBJECTIVE_MODEL_NAME` — model being tested
   - `ADVERSARIAL_MODEL_NAME` — model PyRIT uses to generate attacks
7. Run Cell 3.
8. When the PyRIT menu appears:
   - Enter `1` to `13` for an individual attack
   - Enter `ALL` to execute all PyRIT attacks
9. Garak will run automatically after PyRIT completes.
10. Save the generated reports for analysis.

Only perform security testing against systems you are authorized to test.
